/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Repositories_MCC Music Composition Core (MCC)
 * @ingroup RoModular_Repositories
 * @brief Portable music-theory and composition primitives.
 *
 * | Field | Value |
 * | ----- | ----- |
 * | Role | Pitch, interval, tuning, and future music-composition domain models |
 * | Current development version | `0.2.0` |
 * | Status | Active reconstruction |
 * | Source | [ChecheRomo96/MusicCompositionCore](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/MusicCompositionCore) |
 * | Documentation | [MusicCompositionCore on GitHub Pages](https://checheromo96.github.io/MusicCompositionCore/) |
 * | Runtime dependency | Foundation `1.2.0` or a compatible newer 1.x release |
 * | Public CMake target | `MCC::MCC` |
 *
 * MCC owns music theory and composition semantics, not MIDI. It consumes
 * Foundation only through the public `Foundation::Foundation` target and uses
 * the same pinned RoModularBuild `v0.4.0` release already validated by
 * Foundation.
 */
